I could use this too. I've been trying to make a transformer from [Dhall to Webmanifest](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@toastal/parcel-transformer-dhall-webmanifest) (via JSON). I would have thought changing the type to `webmanifest` in the transformer would have been enough but the URLs never get resolved. I suppose my transformer could do more, but I think it could be even easier of I could do 
```json
{ ...,
  "transformers": {
    "manifest.dhall": [
      "@toastal/parcel-transformer-dhall-json",
      "@parcel/transformer-webmanifest"
    ]
  }
}
```

I think this could apply to a lot of options that can `toJSON` -- like [CSON](https://github.com/bevry/cson), etc.

